<title>UK: SBC Warburg leads $526 million two-tranche bond.</title>
<headline>SBC Warburg leads $526 million two-tranche bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg has lead-managed a $526,710 million two-tranche asset-backed bond for First USA Credit Card Master Trust Series 1996-7.  </p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS A</p>
<p> AMT $483,060,000 MLN SPREAD    *+9.5 BP   EXP MAT	 .FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	*1M LIBOR  PAY DATE    11.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 FULL FEES   15 CENTS</p>
<p> UNSUBORDINATED	 MGT/UND    5 CENTS   SELL CONC   10 CENTS</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS B</p>
<p> AMT  $43,650,000     SPREAD    *+29 BP    EXP MAT	 .FEB 00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	*1M LIBOR  PAY DATE    11.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  SUBORDINATED	   FULL FEES   20 CENTS</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   MGT/UND  12.5 CENTS  SELL CONC   7.5 CENTS</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (B) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  NOTES	*TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
